                          <SHORT-NAME>CanControllerFdBaudrateConfig</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>This optional container contains bit timing related configuration parameters of the CAN controller(s) for payload and CRC of a CAN FD frame. If this container exists the controller supports CAN FD frames.</DESC>
